@startuml
'https://plantuml.com/sequence-diagram

autonumber

Bob -> App : Search for a Tune by name or alias, Dance type and key
return A list of matching Tunes
Bob -> App : View Tune detail
return The Tune detail (sheet and ABC, composer, Performances and related Tracks,\nrecorded by Musicians and Bands, played by Accounts)
Bob -> App : Listen to the ABC (browser synth, tempo control)
Bob -> App : Listen to a Track where this Tune is played
Bob -> App : Add this Tune to his Repertoire
Bob -> App : Add this Tune to one of his Sets
Bob -> App : Comment on the Tune
Bob -> App : Add the Track to his Favourites
Bob -> App : Browse more Tracks and Albums of the same Artist
@enduml
